+        </div>
+        <h1 style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 800, margin: "0 0 8px", letterSpacing: "-0.02em" }}>
+          You&apos;re offline
+        </h1>
+        <p style={{ fontSize: 14, lineHeight: 1.6, color: "#806C7B", margin: "0 0 20px" }}>
+          No connection to the PropCare NW platform. Previously loaded inspections and
+          portfolio data remain available from your device cache.
